{"t":"XYZ","made":"2026-11-11 10:29","name":"Block, Inc.","ko":null,"sector":"Technology","industry":"Software - Infrastructure","employees":10205,"hq":"Oakland, CA, United States","website":"https://www.block.xyz","summary_en":"Block, Inc., together with its subsidiaries, builds ecosystems focused on commerce and financial products and services in the United States and internationally. It operates through two segments: Square and Cash App. The Square segment offers managed payment services; software solutions; hardware products, such as registers, terminals, stands, and readers for contactless and chips; banking services consisting of lending, instant transfer, and checking and savings accounts; and full-service setup and support services. This segment also provides loyalty, marketing, team management, and payroll services; and gift cards. It also offers Square Handheld, a portable point-of sale device for transaction purposes. The Cash App segment offers financial tools, including peer-to-peer payments, bitcoin, and stock investment brokerage; Cash App Card, a debit card; Cash App Pay, mobile-friendly way for cash app customers to pay at merchants across online and in-person channels; direct deposit, stock brokerage, and tax preparation services; and Afterpay, a buy now, pay later platform. In addition, the company operates TIDAL, a platform for musicians and fans; TBD, an open developer platform focused on making the decentralized financial world accessible; Bitkey, a self-custody bitcoin wallet; and proto. The company was formerly known as Square, Inc. and changed its name to Block, Inc. in December 2021. Block, Inc. was incorporated in 2009 and is based in Oakland, California.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Block, Inc.는 자회사와 함께 미국 및 국제적으로 상업 및 금융 상품과 서비스에 초점을 맞춘 생태계를 구축합니다. Square와 Cash App이라는 두 가지 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. Square 부문은 관리형 결제 서비스를 제공합니다. 소프트웨어 솔루션; 비접촉식 및 칩용 레지스터, 터미널, 스탠드, 리더기 등의 하드웨어 제품; 대출, 즉시 이체, 당좌 예금 계좌로 구성된 은행 서비스; 그리고 풀 서비스 설정 및 지원 서비스. 이 부문은 충성도, 마케팅, 팀 관리 및 급여 서비스도 제공합니다. 그리고 기프트 카드. 또한 거래 목적을 위한 휴대용 POS 장치인 Square Handheld도 제공합니다. Cash App 부문은 P2P 결제, 비트코인, 주식 투자 중개 등 금융 도구를 제공합니다. 현금앱카드, 직불카드; Cash App Pay는 현금 앱 고객이 온라인 및 오프라인 채널을 통해 판매자에게 결제할 수 있는 모바일 친화적인 방법입니다. 계좌 입금, 주식 중개 및 세금 준비 서비스; 지금 구매하고 나중에 결제하는 플랫폼인 Afterpay도 있습니다. 또한, 뮤지션과 팬을 위한 플랫폼인 TIDAL을 운영하고 있습니다. 분산형 금융 세계에 접근할 수 있도록 하는 데 초점을 맞춘 개방형 개발자 플랫폼인 TBD; 자체 보관형 비트코인 ​​지갑인 Bitkey; 그리고 프로토. 이 회사는 이전에 Square, Inc.로 알려졌으며 2021년 12월에 Block, Inc.로 이름을 변경했습니다. Block, Inc.는 2009년에 설립되었으며 캘리포니아주 오클랜드에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":85.58,"mcap":51734990848.0,"pe":112.60527,"fpe":15.936448,"peg":0.6725,"ps":2.017244,"pb":2.258405,"ev_ebitda":32.364,"div":0.0,"beta":2.559,"hi52":89.395,"lo52":48.21},"fin":{"rev":25646370816.0,"rev_g":0.099,"eps_g":0.238,"gross":0.47704,"op":0.06651,"net":0.01798,"roe":0.02021,"fcf":837104256.0,"cash":8244548096.0,"debt":7535432192.0,"de":32.949,"eps":0.76,"feps":5.37008},"own":{"short":0.0294,"inst":0.83959,"insider":0.0115},"analyst":{"n":42,"mean":100.45881,"median":101.0,"high":125.0,"low":80.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":1.59574,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":10,"buy":28,"hold":9,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":9,"buy":29,"hold":9,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":10,"buy":28,"hold":9,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":10,"buy":28,"hold":7,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-09","Firm":"Cantor Fitzgerald","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":102.0,"priorPriceTarget":95.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-05","Firm":"Barclays","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":105.0,"priorPriceTarget":100.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-05","Firm":"Wells Fargo","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":110.0